      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just a way to sugarcoat it. \"creating meaning\" is just a coping mechanism to ignore the fact that we're just biological accidents. if we look at it purely logically, if the net value of existence is zero or negative due to all the suffering, then choosing to exit is actually the most rational, balanced choice. it's not even a tragedy, it's just settling the equation. don't you think?",
